# Markdown Formatting Guidelines

1. ✅ Always use `-` hyphens for unordered lists
2. ✅ Always use `\```\` backticks for code blocks except when nesting them:
   - When nesting code blocks, use tildes `~~~` to start and end the block, and specify the language e.g.

```markdown
This is a markdown codeblock

~~~xml
<this>Is a nested XML codeblock</this>
~~~
```